      "writtenOn": "2022-03-28T17:40:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually I have lightPos prior to calling into Skia which looks like it isn\u0027t the same thing as this because it could have been mutated by the kDirectionalLight_ShadowFlag.  So I think my previous question does not matter.",
      "parentUuid": "0e428abf_fde9c7f7",
      "revId": "56b7a0509260700805344616caca54664cd9052a",
